<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS4.SSS4" title="In III-D Stage 3: Trace-Aware Optimization and Pruning ‣ III METHODOLOGY ‣ AutoVeriFix+: High-Correctness RTL Generation via Trace-Aware Causal Fix and Semantic Redundancy Pruning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-D</span>4 </span>Redundancy Elimination and Optimization</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS5" title="In III METHODOLOGY ‣ AutoVeriFix+: High-Correctness RTL Generation via Trace-Aware Causal Fix and Semantic Redundancy Pruning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Summary</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
